                <head>[Per Atlantic cable.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">London,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-09-19"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 19, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Plate affair settled. Washburn notified to pass blockade.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JAMES WATSON WEBB.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
